  ('91a8adb3-eb43-5656-b598-433daa5fb0d0', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g7-context-clues'), null, 'hard',
   $q$Paragraph 5 calls the pipes "a compromise." Based on the paragraph, what is a compromise?$q$, $q$[{"text":"a tool that lowers the level of water","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"a plan that gives one side everything it wants","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"ignores-context"},{"text":"a solution where each side gets part of what it wants","is_correct":true},{"text":"a mistake that causes damage to roads","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$a solution where each side gets part of what it wants$q$, $q$The pipes let "the beavers stay while reducing the damage," giving "both people and animals part of what they need," which describes a compromise. The pipes lower the water, but the word names the shared solution, not the tool itself.$q$, 'draft', '8ecb03e1-6891-583a-a797-3ac053ef04fc')
